WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:18.750
Set the boundary around the complete vehicle system.

2
00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:37.500
Separate the layers to expose the interfaces between subsystems.

3
00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:56.250
Trace energy, force, information, and heat across those interfaces.

4
00:00:56.250 --> 00:01:15.000
Reconnect the system map and inspect the unresolved links.
